# The deck list's menu: review settings and the licences page, after the
# sample deck is started.
wait-for No collection yet
tap Start with the sample
wait-for Choose a deck
clean
shot decks
tap-id more
tap Review settings
wait-for Card details
expect Information shown during review
clean
shot settings
tap Back
wait-for Choose a deck
tap-id more
tap Licences & about
wait-for On this device
clean
shot about
tap Done
wait-for Choose a deck
